IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ssc-core`
IMPORT `ssc9-sch11`

-- Tests for ssc9-sch11.l4 (Schedule 11). Expected values are written by hand from the text, beside each assertion.

§ `Tests -- Schedule 11`

§§ `The relevant date and the 57-day and 85-day windows`

#ASSERT `sch 11 the relevant date` (Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS Date 10 3 2025
-- Relevant date 10 March 2025: the 57 days ending immediately before it are 12 January to 9 March 2025 (10 March minus 57 days is 12 January 2025).
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 12 1 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 9 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 11 1 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 11 1 2025, Date 1 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) the employee had such a day in the 57 days` (Date 10 3 2025) EMPTY EQUALS FALSE
-- 85 days ending immediately before 10 March 2025: 10 March minus 85 days is 15 December 2024.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(dd) the circumstance applies` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 15 12 2024) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(dd) the circumstance applies` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 14 12 2024) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(dd) the circumstance applies` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 9 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(dd) the circumstance applies` (Date 10 3 2025) (LIST Date 10 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE

§§ `The exceptions to paragraph 2(d)(i)`

-- Argument order: otherwise met; relevant date; the day the employee attains pensionable age; entitled to incapacity benefit at the relevant date; the days after the relevant date on which not entitled; the day asked about.
-- Under pensionable age throughout: the circumstance stands.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2030) TRUE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- Over pensionable age at the relevant date and not entitled to incapacity benefit: it does not apply. On the day of attaining the age counts as over it.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 10 3 2025) FALSE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 11 3 2025) FALSE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- Over pensionable age but entitled to incapacity benefit at the relevant date: the circumstance still applies.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- (2): it ceases to apply from a day after the relevant date on which the employee is over pensionable age and not entitled. Asked about a day before that day: still applies.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (LIST Date 15 3 2025) (Date 14 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (LIST Date 15 3 2025) (Date 15 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE (LIST Date 15 3 2025) (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE
-- A day of non-entitlement before attaining the age does not end it.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` TRUE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE (LIST Date 15 3 2025) (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- Not otherwise met: false throughout.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(d)(i) applies on the day` FALSE (Date 10 3 2025) (Date 1 1 2030) TRUE EMPTY (Date 20 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE

§§ `Paragraph 2(f) -- no work, and the joining rule`

-- Argument order: no work under the new contract; no work under the previous contract; the day the previous contract ceased; the day the new contract takes effect.
-- New contract starting exactly 8 weeks (56 days) after the previous ended: joined. Work under the previous contract then counts: not "no work".
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the employee has done no work for the employer under the contract of service` TRUE FALSE (JUST (Date 1 1 2025)) (Date 26 2 2025) EQUALS FALSE
-- 57 days after: not joined; only the new contract counts.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the employee has done no work for the employer under the contract of service` TRUE FALSE (JUST (Date 1 1 2025)) (Date 27 2 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- Joined, and no work under either: still no work.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the employee has done no work for the employer under the contract of service` TRUE TRUE (JUST (Date 1 1 2025)) (Date 26 2 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- Work under the new contract: not "no work", joined or not.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the employee has done no work for the employer under the contract of service` FALSE TRUE (JUST (Date 1 1 2025)) (Date 26 2 2025) EQUALS FALSE
-- No previous contract: only the new one counts.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the employee has done no work for the employer under the contract of service` TRUE FALSE NOTHING (Date 26 2 2025) EQUALS TRUE
-- The circumstance is that answer.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the circumstance applies` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(f) the circumstance applies` FALSE EQUALS FALSE

§§ `Paragraphs 2(g) and 2(h)`

#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(g) the circumstance applies` TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(g) the circumstance applies` TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(g) the circumstance applies` FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- Argument order: is or has been pregnant; within the disqualifying period (s 153(12)); terminated before the disqualifying period began; terminated otherwise than by confinement (s 171(1)).
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- The exception needs BOTH limbs: terminated before the period began AND otherwise than by confinement.
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 2(h) the circumstance applies` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

§§ `Paragraph 1 -- the rule`

#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `sch 11 para 1 a period of entitlement may arise` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
